<title>GERMANY: Boewe Systec to issue 1.6 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Boewe Systec to issue 1.6 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>AUGSBURG, Germany 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German paper management systems maker Boewe Systec AG on Thursday said it was raising its capital by eight million marks to 30 million marks by offering 1.6 million new shares at 30 marks each.</p>
<p>The shares are nominally valued at five marks.</p>
<p>Shareholders will receive four new shares for 11 old shares, and the group said the shares will be eligible for the entire 1996 dividend. The subscription period will run form November 20 to December 4.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
